# React & TypeScript

## Components

- Functional components only; `export default` for components, named exports for hooks/utils
- Define props with `interface XxxProps` colocated in the same file
- Import shared types with `import type { Asset } from '../types'`
- No `import React` unless using React APIs directly (new JSX transform)

## State & Data

- Local persisted state: `useLocalStorageState<T>(key, initial, ownerId)`
- Server/async data: TanStack React Query hooks in `src/hooks/`
- Keep calculation logic in `src/utils/`, not inline in components

## Styling

- Tailwind utility classes; follow existing card/modal patterns in sibling components
- Semantic HTML (`button`, `nav`, `main`) and keyboard-accessible controls

## TypeScript

- `strict: true`; prefer explicit interfaces over `any`
- Add new shared types to `src/types/index.ts`
- Use type guards for filters: `.filter((s): s is string => !!s)`

## Asset types

```typescript
// Branch by ASSET_TYPES — don't hardcode type strings
if (asset.type === ASSET_TYPES.PLAZO_FIJO) return <PlazoFijoCard ... />
if (asset.type === ASSET_TYPES.EFECTIVO) return <EfectivoCard ... />
```

## Formatting

- No semicolons, single quotes, no trailing commas required
- Match import order: react → external libs → hooks → config/utils → types → components
